Simple Calculator in C
Description
A simple calculator program developed using the C programming language.

Features
Addition
Subtraction
Multiplication
Division
Division-by-zero error handling
Files
calculator.c - Calculator source code
data.txt - Sample test data
README.md - Project documentation
How to Run
Compile the program using GCC:

gcc calculator.c -o calculator
Run on Windows:

calculator.exe
Language
C Programming

Author
Beginner C Programming Project
